# Independently authored from pinned public IOS raw interface lines; not an NTC template copy.
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CAPACITY_KBIT_S (\d+)
Value INPUT_BYTES (\d+)
Value OUTPUT_BYTES (\d+)

Start
  ^\S+ is .*, line protocol is .* -> Continue.Record
  ^${INTERFACE} is .*, line protocol is .*
  ^\s+MTU \d+ bytes, BW ${CAPACITY_KBIT_S} Kbit/sec,
  ^\s+\d+ packets input, ${INPUT_BYTES} bytes,
  ^\s+\d+ packets output, ${OUTPUT_BYTES} bytes,
